      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Inc. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "A novel magnetic MIL-53(Fe) photocatalyst (MAG-MIL) has been synthesized by an in-situ ethylenediamine (EDA)-assisted solvothermal method. The well dispersed γ-Fe2O3 nanoparticles embedded in the MAG-MIL framework contribute to a red shift of the light absorption edge as well as the superparamagnetism characteristic."
      },
